sanaku/site/*.pdf

# Local harness state (session settings, background-agent worktrees) — not
# project content, never belongs in the repo.
.claude/

# Exception: project-scoped slash commands, deliberately tracked so they
# persist across sessions and are available in this repo's own command
# menu — not personal/local session state like the rest of .claude/.
!.claude/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/*.md
